	"system": {
		"description": {
			"value": "<p><em>You pass your hand through the air, sending healing magic to thoroughly cleanse your target.</em></p><p><strong>Healing</strong></p><p>This spell has no effect on &amp;reference[construct]{Constructs}.</p><ul><li><p>Target gains [[/heal]] hit points.*</p></li><li><p>Target loses the &amp;reference[Blinded apply=false], &amp;reference[Deafened apply=false], &amp;reference[Paralyzed apply=false], &amp;reference[Poisoned apply=false], and &amp;reference[weakened apply=false] conditions, as well as any diseases.</p></li></ul><p>* <strong>Upcasting:</strong> Increase healing by [[/healing 10]]{10} for each spell level above 6th.</p>",
